title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320616005:1":{"text":"他铁面，严肃，知识渊博，我和哥哥都很害怕他的戒尺。","source_cn":"他铁面，严肃，知识渊博，我和哥哥都很害怕他的戒尺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D41B5DEC68CB389","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320616006:1":{"text":"……戒尺！难道你们会遭受惩罚？","source_cn":"……戒尺！难道你们会遭受惩罚？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80EC646BB0ABF43F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320616007:1":{"text":"奥列格老师对我还好，只是训斥。但是哥哥他……他是家族的继承人，所以受到的教导更严格。","source_cn":"奥列格老师对我还好，只是训斥。但是哥哥他……他是家族的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F27B269F0A8F592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320616008:1":{"text":"老师说，哥哥的魔法天赋不如我，所以他需要更多磨炼……他努力了，我看到铐兰哥哥整日与书为伴，拼命完成奥列格老师布置的每一项作业。","source_cn":"老师说，哥哥的魔法天赋不如我，所以他需要更多磨炼……他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FA96EC1FA1BD4B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320616009:1":{"text":"但最后，戒尺还是会敲在他的手心上。","source_cn":"但最后，戒尺还是会敲在他的手心上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4A42DF825E6A642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12